{"id":"b1e458e60c7225cd","group":"56","path":"56/56-ex-residual-copy-erasure-creation.md","title":"复制、删除、保留与新建的同一步例子","display":"ex-residual-copy-erasure-creation — 复制、删除、保留与新建的同一步例子","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-ex-residual-copy-erasure-creation","aliases":["56-ex-residual-copy-erasure-creation"],"display":"ex-residual-copy-erasure-creation — 复制、删除、保留与新建的同一步例子","depends_on":["[[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]","[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]","[[56-df-orthogonal]]"],"source_section":"§4.2 Example 4.2.12","source_printed_pages":"98","source_ocr_blocks":[119],"source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; occurrence-coding-local","source_proof_status":"scope-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-ex-residual-copy-erasure-creation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-ex-residual-copy-erasure-creation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-residual-copy-erasure-creation — 复制、删除、保留与新建的同一步例子"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a68d684938525240\" href=\"?note=a68d684938525240\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal-residual\">56-df-orthogonal-residual</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4634b959eefaa45b\" href=\"?note=4634b959eefaa45b\" title=\"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation\">56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.2 Example 4.2.12"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"98"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>119</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr; occurrence-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"scope-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c,d,F,G,H\">\\(a,b,c,d,F,G,H\\)</span> 是两两不同的函数符号，前四者为常元，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F,G\">\\(F,G\\)</span> 元数2，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H\">\\(H\\)</span> 元数1。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 可数无限且与符号集不交，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\\in V\">\\(x,y\\in V\\)</span> 不同；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 由这些符号与元数确定。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\">\\(\\epsilon\\)</span> 为根位置，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i_1,\\ldots,i_k)\">\\((i_1,\\ldots,i_k)\\)</span> 表示位置序列。红项、具体步、残余与Created见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a68d684938525240\" href=\"?note=a68d684938525240\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal-residual\">56-df-orthogonal-residual</a>；类型和不交性见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4634b959eefaa45b\" href=\"?note=4634b959eefaa45b\" title=\"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation\">56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"34fb9d07dfbad48c\" href=\"?note=34fb9d07dfbad48c\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal\">56-df-orthogonal</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"R\\coloneqq\\{(a,b),(b,c),(c,d),(F(x,y),G(y,y)),(G(x,H(y)),H(y))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[R\\coloneqq\\{(a,b),(b,c),(c,d),(F(x,y),G(y,y)),(G(x,H(y)),H(y))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Orthogonal}(\\Sigma,V,R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"s\\coloneqq G(F(c,H(a)),H(b)),\\qquad t\\coloneqq G(G(H(a),H(a)),H(b)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[s\\coloneqq G(F(c,H(a)),H(b)),\\qquad t\\coloneqq G(G(H(a),H(a)),H(b)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"v\\coloneqq((1),F(x,y),G(y,y)),\\quad\\alpha\\coloneqq(s,v,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[v\\coloneqq((1),F(x,y),G(y,y)),\\quad\\alpha\\coloneqq(s,v,t)\\in\\operatorname{Step}_R.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"u_a\\coloneqq((1,2,1),a,b),\\quad u_b\\coloneqq((2,1),b,c),\\quad u_c\\coloneqq((1,1),c,d),\\quad u_G\\coloneqq(\\epsilon,G(x,H(y)),H(y)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[u_a\\coloneqq((1,2,1),a,b),\\quad u_b\\coloneqq((2,1),b,c),\\quad u_c\\coloneqq((1,1),c,d),\\quad u_G\\coloneqq(\\epsilon,G(x,H(y)),H(y)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R(\\alpha,u_a)=\\{((1,1,1),a,b),((1,2,1),a,b)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R(\\alpha,u_a)=\\{((1,1,1),a,b),((1,2,1),a,b)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R(\\alpha,u_b)=\\{u_b\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R(\\alpha,u_c)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R(\\alpha,v)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R(\\alpha,u_b)=\\{u_b\\},\\qquad\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R(\\alpha,u_c)=\\varnothing,\\qquad\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R(\\alpha,v)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R(\\alpha,u_G)=\\{u_G\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Res}^{1}_R(\\alpha,u_G)=\\{u_G\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Created}_R(\\alpha)=\\{((1),G(x,H(y)),H(y))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Created}_R(\\alpha)=\\{((1),G(x,H(y)),H(y))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逐项核对原书例4.2.12：F规则复制y=H(a)、删除x=c；不交的b和外层G红项仍保留，旧F红项自身消失。新位置(1)上的G(H(a),H(a))匹配G规则，它不是任何旧红项的残余。此例只声称一个具体步的残余计算，有限枚举记录另存本轮证据；一般保持性由上游定理承担。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的Terese (2003)本地DjVu，原文件与上轮提取的规范化文字哈希本轮重新核对一致；OCR块按U+001F分段从1编号，不等于物理扫描页。未取得PDF页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-orthogonal-residual","status":"resolved","id":"a68d684938525240","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"4634b959eefaa45b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","